// prevents `do` from being treated as a newline-infix operator. In the `if` block,
// `arrMatches !== null` and `do ()` are parsed as separate block items instead of
// `arrMatches !== null do ()`. Fixing requires the same context-sensitive parsing
// refactoring mentioned above.

